---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultForm from '../components/ConsultForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="CGO AI Market Intelligence | Lozen Advisory" description="Focused research and CFO-ready intelligence on AI accountability, legislation, workforce exposure, D&O risk, and emerging governance expectations.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="/#services">Services</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Board AI Market Intelligence</div>
    <span class="pill">Research & Analysis</span>
    <div class="ic-lg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:52px;height:52px;color:var(--accent-2)"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div>
    <h1>Board AI Market Intelligence</h1>
    <p class="sub">The absence of data is not the absence of risk.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#consult" class="btn btn-accent">Request Market Intelligence →</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Overview</span>
      <h2 class="h2">See the exposure before it appears in standard reporting.</h2>
      <p>Boards and executives are making AI decisions while legislation, insurance expectations, and accountability standards are still moving.</p>
      <p>Lozen Advisory produces focused intelligence that translates market signals into enterprise governance questions and decision-ready analysis.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="checklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Board-ready market analysis</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>AI legislation intelligence</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>D&O and insurance signals</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Accountability and evidence trends</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Workforce and human-capital exposure</p></div>
        <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Executive decision implications</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What's included</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Everything in this service</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div><h3>Signal analysis</h3><p>Separate material governance developments from market noise.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div><h3>Legislation tracking</h3><p>Translate emerging AI requirements into enterprise exposure.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg></div><h3>Insurance intelligence</h3><p>Identify D&O and underwriting questions moving into governance decisions.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><h3>Accountability trends</h3><p>Track how human attribution and evidence expectations are changing.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>Workforce implications</h3><p>Connect AI adoption to verification strain, succession, and capacity risk.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg></div><h3>Executive brief</h3><p>Deliver concise findings leadership can use immediately.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h2">A clear advisory process</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Frame</h3><p>Define the market, legislation, or governance question leadership needs answered.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Research</h3><p>Examine current signals, source material, and enterprise implications.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Interpret</h3><p>Translate the findings into board, CFO, legal, and risk relevance.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Deliver</h3><p>Provide a focused intelligence product and executive discussion.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Is this a generic research report?</h4><p>No. The work is scoped to a specific governance, market, legislation, or enterprise-risk question.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Can the analysis focus on one jurisdiction or issue?</h4><p>Yes. Engagements can be narrow, comparative, or cross-jurisdictional depending on the decision.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>What does leadership receive?</h4><p>A concise written analysis with enterprise implications, governance questions, and a board-ready discussion frame.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ConsultForm serviceHighlight="board ai market intelligence" selectedService="Board AI Market Intelligence" />
</BaseLayout>
